<title>USA: Lucent names Butcher president of Asia unit.</title>
<headline>Lucent names Butcher president of Asia unit.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Thursday said Michael Butcher has been named president and chief executive of Lucent's Asia/Pacific segment of its Network Systems business, based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Butcher was previously president of Electronic Data Systems Australia/New Zealand unit.</p>
<p>Lucent said he succeeds Jay Carter, &quot;who is returning to the United States after a successful four year assignment&quot;.</p>
